    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58c75f3935b8348d51c9e8bc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是吧～！？　很厉害是吧！？\r\n这孩子，就是我的伙伴『塔酱』哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63a9639e0bab62f8275e4c4d84984179710b15a0b98810612387144aed2cb8c4",
