    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1215883d579333eace84c232",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "时髦酷炫的外观，厚重的引擎声……还有着所谓的\r\n剪刀门，这种竖直开启的车门也很有魅力哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab193c1a8125fd5b0b0baeaf2ae1dd974f514dcf337885519c43bede6d780ca9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1004/storytimeline_041004003.json",
      "json_path": [
