    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf16900edc1b3fc10c200b7b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当然，乘坐体验也是最棒的哦！　你一定得尽情享受一番。\r\n来，快点上车上车！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d8431118c10d6ffe7268a53148f237bd89e75a1cb16f9ba4aec15541ecb3224",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1004/storytimeline_041004003.json",
      "json_path": [
