      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这加速！　这飞过的风景！　很棒对吧！？\r\n但是，塔酱接下来才要使出真本事哦～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fd1dd640db6a178e855ea13d6ba79dc943e06f8c9fc279364a04fd173645521",
