      "uid": "zhcn:5d9cd75e2889bcabcffa7485",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "没事的没事的，我会遵守交通规则的！\r\n不过――会稍微游走于规则边缘的！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8843c6de1f36e3c19d9d49ef848f169465f98bc79f4f59a46d9c65d9d690d7e0",
